# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples) that stage0
# refuses: `refined run` runs it, and stage0 reports the alias it cannot
# compile.

outside is project
outside purpose "Hold an alias, which the stage0 subset does not compile"
outside target console
outside version "0.1.0"
outside language refined 1
outside standardLibrary 1
outside allows none
outside requires none
outside includesModule outside
outside entry outside.main
